@mountainsandcode The issue you referenced is Closed (and Stale). It appears to have been used for a different, more specific change (Webhook for Traccar). The associated PR #24762 was merged in 2019. Given that general GET support for webhooks remains missing, I don't think it's correct to suggest that this issue duplicates that issue.

I'm thrilled to see the PR #56446 for adding general GET support to webhooks. That's great news! However, it's been open since September 2021, and appeared stalled until two days ago. Would be lovely if this issue was a (surely minor) influence to push it through to Merged. 

Please let me know if there's anything I can do to assist. (Not a coder, but I can write docs, etc., if that's useful.)

